  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne stent nan oðer lad æt tihtlan bute ordal betweox Wealan ⁊ Ænglan, bute man ðafian wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Upon accusation, no other exculpation between the English and Welsh is valid except the ordeal, unless one [of the opponents] wants to admit it [the falsity of his claim].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Non stat alia lada (id est purgatio) de tihla (id est compellatione) nisi ordalium inter Walos et Anglos – nisi pati uoluerint.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
